{
 "meta": {
  "title": "Clean a mesh with core nodes",
  "pack": "none: core ComfyUI only",
  "licence": "ComfyUI is GPL-3.0",
  "status": "Runs on any ComfyUI with core's mesh nodes; no pack.",
  "about": "Load a GLB, weld, decimate to a face budget, smooth normals, turn it by a ComfyMathExpression value, measure it before and after with GetMeshInfo, render before and after, save the GLB. The pictures on the 3D page come from this graph's twin.",
  "proved": "Pack Lab lane, 2026-11-02 (core only, no pack used): 181,548 faces in, 6,547 out for a target of 8,000, 1.0 s, 0.8 GiB. Run again from an emptied cache it gave 6,588, so DecimateMesh does not give the same count twice. A World Kit prop (r3d_word_barrel.glb) went through too, but its 12-face collision box is merged in by Get3DComponents, so RenderMesh drew the box: use a mesh with no -colonly part.",
  "needs": [
   "a GLB in input/3d named in node 1"
  ]
 },
